# The GitHub repo is PUBLIC: no real client data in git (sdd-kit GUIA-ESTILO-DOCS §8).
# Everything below stays on the local disk and remains available to every session.

# Client raw material: real phones/addresses, flyers, event photos with identifiable people
/Design_references/

# Research captures: client site screenshots (real contact data), third-party site screenshots,
# logo source export (contains the client's address and phones), inventory with real contact data
/audit/screens/
/audit/reference/
/audit/logo-source.*
/audit/inventory.md
/audit/sites-capture.md
/audit/sites-computed*.json

# Generated pages that embed the booth photo (identifiable people) as base64
/audit/directions.html

# Prototype build output and local check artifacts
/prototype/node_modules/
/prototype/dist/
/prototype/screens/
/prototype/.lead-shot.mjs

# Secrets and OS noise
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
